WEBVTT

00:00:00.682 --> 00:00:01.555
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.277 --> 00:00:04.007
<v><b>A:</b></v> I love classical music.

00:00:04.681 --> 00:00:05.844
<v><b>B:</b></v><b> So do I.</b>

00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:09.855
<v><b>A:</b></v> I went to a classical concert last night.

00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:11.810
<v><b>B:</b></v><b> So did I.</b>

00:00:13.674 --> 00:00:14.560
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:16.340
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m not married.

00:00:17.126 --> 00:00:18.190
<v><b>B:</b></v><b> Neither am I.</b>

00:00:19.816 --> 00:00:21.277
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t want to get married.

00:00:22.134 --> 00:00:23.261
<v><b>B:</b></v><b> Neither do I.</b>